{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02656","headline":"食後 · 王绩","name":"食後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田家无所有，晚食遂爲常。\n菜剪三秋绿，飧炊百日黄。\n胡麻山麨样，楚豆野麋方。\n始暴松皮脯，新添杜若浆。\n葛花消酒毒，萸蔕发羹香。\n鼓腹聊乘兴，宁知逢世昌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02656.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02656","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}